    "low_confidence marks pre-2012 months where MODIS sees almost none of the VIIRS-detected activity or the factor rests on few MODIS fire-days; show them with extra caution.",
    "Fire-days measure burning activity, not burned area.",
    "2026 is a partial year shown for display only.",
    "From the VIIRS switch date (S-NPP's end) harmonized is NOAA-20 calibrated to S-NPP units per calendar month (source = NOAA20); viirs_raw stays S-NPP only, noaa20_raw is the uncalibrated NOAA-20 count.",
    "is_persistent cells contain persistent (industrial / waste-burning) sources; they are excluded from calibration but kept in the data so the UI can show or hide them."
  ]
}